Pi Desktop
==========

A desktop GUI shell for the pi coding agent.

This product includes code derived from the following open-source projects:

ClawX
-----
Portions of this software (Electron shell architecture, host-api IPC
boundary, preload patterns, chat UI mechanics, packaging pipeline) are
derived from ClawX, Copyright (c) ValueCell Team, licensed under the
MIT License. Source files ported from ClawX retain their original
copyright headers where applicable, and individual commit messages
identify the ported file paths ("Ported from ClawX: <path>").

pi (pi-mono)
------------
Pi Desktop integrates with, but does not bundle or copy code from,
the pi coding agent (@earendil-works/pi-coding-agent),
Copyright (c) Mario Zechner, licensed under the MIT License.
pi is provided by the user's own environment installation.

Both projects are used in accordance with the MIT License terms.
